    <string name="about.text"><b>Taki</b> is a focused player for personal and shared music collections. Listen online or download your music for offline playback, without letting the technology get in the way.\n\nTaki works with Navidrome and other servers compatible with the Subsonic and OpenSubsonic APIs.\n\nTaki is free and open-source software based on Ultrasonic and distributed under the GNU GPLv3 license. Ultrasonic and its contributors are credited as the original project.</string>
    <string name="about.webpage.url" translatable="false">https://github.com/churipakinti/taki-android</string>
    <string name="about.report.url" translatable="false">https://github.com/churipakinti/taki-android/issues</string>
